{"id": "EUVD-2026-102276", "enisaUuid": "6b57df26-e575-391f-a4da-18524ddff3a4", "description": "FreeImage (danoli3 fork) through 3.19.23 contains a heap out-of-bounds read vulnerability in Unpack32Bits() in PluginPICT.cpp because rowBytes is never checked against the file-controlled PixMap width. Attackers can supply a crafted PICT file with a truncated or undersized rowBytes to over-read up to 64 KiB of heap, leaking memory into decoded pixels or crashing the process.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T18:57:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T18:57:38", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/freeimage-pict-unpack32bits-plane-conversion-oob-read", "https://github.com/danoli3/FreeImage/blob/cc2bfc1b67d3a10e2c203c56932b09ffb52a4477/Source/FreeImage/PluginPICT.cpp#L605-L650", "https://github.com/danoli3/FreeImage", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/freeimage-through-3.19.23-heap-out-of-bounds-read-via-pict-unpack32bits"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hmpq-mc7h-9mv3", "CVE-2026-111149"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "746545a4-d0a3-390a-91f7-e1a7e8c20362", "product": {"name": "FreeImage", "vendor": {"name": "FreeImage"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.18.0"}, {"id": "a4c74929-71c1-35a9-b0cc-88e76073ea94", "product": {"name": "FreeImage", "vendor": {"name": "FreeImage"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.19.23"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "53bc1224-9205-3837-92a9-1cbab2e898f3", "vendor": {"name": "danoli3"}}, {"id": "cf936b53-bb7a-305a-a49f-902fb47e6c2e", "vendor": {"name": "FreeImage"}}], "isExploited": false}